{"type":"Feature","id":"miami-dade-homicide-15166","properties":{"name":"Homicide · Nov 20, 2003","year":2003,"age":57,"victim_group":"Black","summary":"Victim and a friend were talking in his car when they were approached by an unknown individual whom demanded money, and then shot the deceased. He was married with four children, smoked, drank, did not use drugs, and was self-employed. Victim: age 57, Black. Census Tract 14.01, Miami-Dade County.","source_note":"Miami-Dade homicides 1956–2011 (miami_dade_homicides)."},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[-80.205292,25.839556]}}
{"type":"Feature","id":"miami-dade-homicide-15175","properties":{"name":"Homicide · Dec 8, 2003","year":2003,"age":63,"victim_group":"Latino","summary":"Victim was working as a clerk at a Circle K store when he was shot. He was born in Argentina, came to the US in 1980, worked as a clerk at Circle K, did not smoke, nor drink or use drugs. Victim: age 63, Latino. Census Tract 107.04, Miami-Dade County.","source_note":"Miami-Dade homicides 1956–2011 (miami_dade_homicides)."},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[-80.40557,25.499391]}}
